    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24567" root="صقر" body-key="S">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصقرت الشَّمْسُ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>The sun was,</i> or <i>became,
burning,</i> or <i>fiercely burning;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِتَّقَدَت</span>; (M,
K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِصْمَقَرَّت</span></b> , (L and K in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صمقر</span>,)
in which the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">م</span> is augmentative: (L in that art.:)
the former is from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصتقرت</span> said of fire. (M.)

